            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "In this exercise we prove ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Ptolemy’s Theorem",
              "marks": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ". This states that in a cyclic quadrilateral, the product of the lengths of the diagonals is equal to the sum of the products of the lengths of pairs of opposite sides.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p20-q7-identity",
